WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.060
Tell me again how this is safer than the watchtower.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.620
I said it was quieter, not safer.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.780
Something is moving in there.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.340
That was supposed to help?

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:11.540
Stay close.
